  vendorName: Curator Kensington
  offerText: Sell me your massive, sentimental family heirloom chest. It clears out
    your living space and puts substantial capital right into your hands.
  acceptResultText: You sell your family's heritage. Your room is remarkably open
    and your pockets are full, but a crushing wave of guilt ruins your mood.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to part with your family's past. The giant chest continues
    to cramp your quarters, and your relatives constantly nag you about money.
  acceptedDelayedText: Kensington's lawyers claim the chest contained forged paperwork,
    hitting you with a massive breach-of-contract penalty that wipes out your savings.
